CQ number 37 for the demcare ontology is: What data are measured for a Task?

SELECT DISTINCT ?dataType WHERE {
  ?task a <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#Task> ;
        <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#measuredData> ?data .
  ?data a ?dataType .
  FILTER(?dataType != <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#MeasuredData>)
}

This competency question asks for the types of measured data associated with a Task, such as <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#StressData>, <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#MoodVoiceData>, <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#GaitData>, <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#LatencyData>, <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#CognitiveAbilitiesData>, and <http://www.demcare.eu/ontologies/combined.owl#FunctionalAbilitiesData>.
